WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.300
-Finally
"Thor: Love and Thunder"

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.400
is almost in theaters.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.534
I know.

00:00:05.534 --> 00:00:10.601
I'm excited.

00:00:10.601 --> 00:00:13.133
And ahead of the release,
we thought that we'd share

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:16.234
some fun facts about Marvel's
famous God of Thunder.

00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:18.934
This is
"Thor: Little Known Facts."

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:20.267
-♪ Thor ♪

00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:23.767
♪ Little known facts ♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:25.767
But first, I'm going to need
someone to help me.

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:27.667
His new movie
"Thor: Love and Thunder"

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:31.400
is in theaters on July 8th.
Please welcome Chris Hemsworth.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:36.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:39.434
-Hello.
-Chris!

00:00:39.434 --> 00:00:41.734
-How you doing?
-How are you, bud?

00:00:41.734 --> 00:00:43.767
-I'm very well, mate. Very well.

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:45.067
-Thank you so much
for doing this.

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:47.400
Chris, our researchers found
some interesting facts

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:51.100
about Thor to help fans get
ready for the big premiere.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.334
-Of course, they did Jimmy.

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:54.634
I was very impressed with what
you guys found.

00:00:54.634 --> 00:00:57.501
This stuff -- it's stuff that I
didn't even know.

00:00:57.501 --> 00:01:01.267
Only hard-core comic book fans
do, so it's very exciting.

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:02.901
-I think our research team
did a great job.

00:01:02.901 --> 00:01:05.133
Let's get started with some
little-know facts about Thor.

00:01:05.133 --> 00:01:06.601
Here we go, I'll go first.

00:01:06.601 --> 00:01:09.267
Did you know that Thor's father
is Odin, but his godfather

00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:11.701
is actually
Sean "P. Diddy" Combs.

00:01:11.701 --> 00:01:13.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.167 --> 00:01:15.033
-It's true. It's true.

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.501
It's actually the plot
of this film.

00:01:16.501 --> 00:01:18.000
So we shouldn't say too much
about it.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.300
-Don't spoil it.
Why don't you give me one?

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:23.634
-Asgardians prolong their lives
by eating

00:01:23.634 --> 00:01:25.534
the Golden Apples of Idunn.

00:01:25.534 --> 00:01:30.767
The Asgardians learned of the
apples in an article on Goop.

00:01:30.767 --> 00:01:34.200
-Wow.
I didn't know they had Goop.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:37.234
-Gwyneth Paltrow link there.
-Yeah, I love those articles.

00:01:37.234 --> 00:01:38.534
How about this one?

00:01:38.534 --> 00:01:42.534
Thor's full name is actually
Courtney Thorne Smith.

00:01:42.534 --> 00:01:44.367
Did you know that?
-Can you believe it?

00:01:44.367 --> 00:01:47.300
-Yeah.
these are all fascinating.

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:50.501
-In this one, Thor has to get a
job because he lost all of his

00:01:50.501 --> 00:01:54.634
money on "Thored Ape" NFTs.
-Oh, it's tough.

00:01:54.634 --> 00:01:57.601
-He's a big metaverse guy.
-It's a tough market right now.

00:01:57.601 --> 00:01:59.634
How about this one?
Everyone knows Chris Hemsworth's

00:01:59.634 --> 00:02:02.434
brothers Liam and Luke,
but he also has a fourth brother

00:02:02.434 --> 00:02:04.033
named Clemsworth Hemsworth.

00:02:04.033 --> 00:02:06.000
He plays bass with
the Jonas Brothers.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:08.234 --> 00:02:10.767
-Clemsworth, is a guy.
-He's good.

00:02:10.767 --> 00:02:12.234
Talented, talented,
talented guy.

00:02:12.234 --> 00:02:15.701
Why don't you give me one?
-Thor's hammer is named Mjolnir.

00:02:15.701 --> 00:02:18.501
His belt is named is Megingjord.

00:02:18.501 --> 00:02:20.467
And his pecks are named
Bert and Ernie.

00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:21.934
[ Laughter and applause ]
-There you go.

00:02:21.934 --> 00:02:23.968
That's what I'm talking about.
My thanks to Chris Hemsworth.

00:02:23.968 --> 00:02:27.601
His new movie "Thor: Love and
Thunder" is out July 8th.

00:02:27.601 --> 00:02:29.901
Thank you, buddy.
Always good to see you.

00:02:29.901 --> 00:02:31.300
-You too. Thank you.
-He's the greatest.

